Reverted the default permission class to ``DomainBasedPermission`` (PULP-2120). The RBAC default (``PulpServiceAccessPolicy``) scoped content reads by repository membership, which hid orphan (not-yet-in-a-repository) content and broke read-after-upload flows such as copr fetching a package by href before adding it to a repository. RBAC will be reintroduced separately once content-read scoping handles these cases.
